id=leica_camera_enabler
name=Leica Camera Enabler (Safe)
version=v1.2
versionCode=3
author=mexus
description=Enables Leica camera features on Xiaomi 17 Ultra (nezha). Sets the Leica props and installs an LSPOSED companion that removes the non-working gallery frames, hides the Leica camera-ring settings, and renames the watermark to "XIAOMI 17 Ultra by Leica". Does not spoof model or attestation flags.
